{"name":"Man Cave","hex":"#816045","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"man cave","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A part of a home specifically reserved for adult male activities, such as drinking beer, playing games and watching TV; often a garage or den.","The vulva or vagina of a trans man.(Can we verify this sense?)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/man_cave"}],"entries":[{"title":"Man cave","blocks":[{"text":"A man cave, mancave, or manspace, and less commonly a manland or mantuary, is a male retreat or sanctuary in a home, such as a specially equipped garage, spare bedroom, media room, den, basement, or tree house. The term \"man cave\" describes an area in the home where a man can do as he pleases in a masculine space."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Man_cave_motorcycles.jpg/330px-Man_cave_motorcycles.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Man_cave","wikidata":"Q1888490"},{"title":"Man","blocks":[{"text":"A man is an adult male human. Before adulthood, a male child or adolescent is referred to as a boy."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Outdoors-man-portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Outdoors-man-portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Man","wikidata":"Q8441"},{"title":"Cave","blocks":[{"text":"Caves and caverns are natural voids under the surface of the Earth and have also been observed in other rocky worlds. Caves often form by the weathering of rock and can extend deep underground. Exogene caves are smaller openings that extend a relatively short distance underground. Caves which extend farther underground than the opening is wide are called endogene caves."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Lechuguilla_Cave_Pearlsian_Gulf.jpg/330px-Lechuguilla_Cave_Pearlsian_Gulf.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cave","wikidata":"Q35509"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Refined_Mancave.jpg/500px-Refined_Mancave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Refined_Mancave.jpg/1280px-Refined_Mancave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Refined_Mancave.jpg/500px-Refined_Mancave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A man cave serving as a home office (5m x 5m size)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARefined_Mancave.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Man_Cave.jpg/500px-Man_Cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Man_Cave.jpg/1280px-Man_Cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Man_Cave.jpg/500px-Man_Cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A man cave arranged as a pool room, with beer advertisements on the wall.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMan_Cave.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/NHGRI_human_male_karyotype.png/500px-NHGRI_human_male_karyotype.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/NHGRI_human_male_karyotype.png/1280px-NHGRI_human_male_karyotype.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/NHGRI_human_male_karyotype.png/500px-